cond shotting gun and i respect that i  don't need him to crush the strongest  fighter in the world easily after  getting a new form even if vegeta isn't  the one to defeat granola i am totally  satisfied with what we saw from him in  the last two chapters totally epic with  an asterisk there for trying to destroy  the planet as always let me know what  you thought of this chapter did you  enjoy it as much as i did or are you  dissatisfied with vegeta's performance  i'd love to hear what you think below if  you do enjoy seeing these dragon ball  super reviews and want to keep them  coming channel the god destruction  within and destroy that like button that  pun alone deserves a like if you have it  make this the video you subscribe and  this is crucial hit that notification  bell to turn on all notifications or you  will miss future dragon ball super and  vegeta updates and as i said no one  wants to miss vegeta updates and until  next time see ya space cowboys  [Music]  so  [Music]
 

